                {
                    "name": "vx-panel",
                    "description": "A nestable container for a logical grouping of content. When nested, the panel's colors\r\ncan be adjusted using the level attribute. 0 is the bottom-most level.  Higher levels\r\nlighten or darken the panel depending on whether the theme is light or dark.\r\n### Slots\r\n- `header` - The header of the panel.\r\n- `footer` - The footer of the panel.\r\n### CSS Properties\r\n- `--vx-panel-color` - The background color of the panel\r\n- `--vx-text-color` - The text color of the panel`",
                    "source": {
                        "module": "./src/components/vx-panel/vx-panel.component.ts",
                        "symbol": "VxPanel"
                    },
                    "attributes": [
                        {
                            "name": "level",
                            "required": false,
                            "priority": "normal",
                            "value": {
                                "type": [
                                    "0",
                                    "1",
                                    "2",
                                    "3",
                                    "4",
                                    "5",
                                    "6"
                                ],
                                "required": true,
                                "default": "0"
                            },
                            "description": "The attribute `level` represents the panel's hierarchy level on the page.  The base level `0` (default) is\r\nthe bottom-most level.\r\n\r\nA value of `0` typically indicates the initial or base level. The\r\ninterpretation of the levels may vary depending on the specific application\r\nor domain.\r\n\r\nIt is expected to hold numerical values, where each increment or decrement\r\nsymbolizes progression or regression in the sequence of levels.",
                            "source": {
                                "module": "./src/components/vx-panel/vx-panel.component.ts",
                                "symbol": "VxPanel.level"
                            }
                        }
                    ],
                    "js": {
                        "properties": [
                            {
                                "name": "styles",
                                "required": false,
                                "priority": "normal",
                                "value": {
                                    "type": "CSSResult",
                                    "required": true,
                                    "default": "\"css`\\r\\n        :host {\\r\\n            display: block;\\r\\n            padding: 0;\\r\\n            margin: 1em;\\r\\n            border-radius: 0.5em;\\r\\n            border: 1px solid;\\r\\n            --border-color: none;\\r\\n            --background-color: none;\\r\\n            ${assignColors(0)}\\r\\n        }\\r\\n        :host([level=\\\"1\\\"]) { ${assignColors(10)} }\\r\\n        :host([level=\\\"2\\\"]) { ${assignColors(20)} }\\r\\n        :host([level=\\\"3\\\"]) { ${assignColors(30)} }\\r\\n        :host([level=\\\"4\\\"]) { ${assignColors(40)} }\\r\\n        :host([level=\\\"5\\\"]) { ${assignColors(50)} }\\r\\n        :host([level=\\\"6\\\"]) { ${assignColors(60)} }\\r\\n        \\r\\n        div {\\r\\n            padding: 0.5em;\\r\\n        }\\r\\n        \\r\\n        div#header, div#footer {\\r\\n            border: none;\\r\\n        }\\r\\n        div#body.has-header {\\r\\n            border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color);\\r\\n        }\\r\\n        div#body.has-footer {\\r\\n            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);\\r\\n        }\\r\\n    `\""
                                },
                                "source": {
                                    "module": "./src/components/vx-panel/vx-panel.component.ts",
                                    "symbol": "VxPanel.styles"
                                }
